{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch","id":991283,"title":"The Final Stretch","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-21T22:26:04-07:00","id":991283,"title":"The Final Stretch","content":"We are nearly the end of the KS, my friends. In nine to ten hours, it shall be concluded with a total over 320k. One more stretch goal lies ahead, at 330k, and the list of accomplishments behind has thoroughly filled out the Companion, funded an Earplay interactive audio drama, brought a new book, the bestiary, to life, created a platform for licensed community material, funded the creation of commemorative dice, and more! If you've been on the fence about backing, now is the time to do so. Even those just backing enough for the PDFs will be also receiving a veritable laundry list of perks alongside them. <br /> <br /> But most of all, I want to thank the OPP team for making this an awesome and exciting Kickstarter. You guys put your hearts into it, through ups and downs, and we can't thank you enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7621-threadwrought","name":"Threadwrought","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T22:33:17-07:00","id":991286,"title":"","content":"Always good strategy for the last stretch goal (or 2) to be something theoretically cool to have, but something that won't be cried over if missed. Don't want want a repeat of Mummy the Curse fans still smarting over the Book of Going Westward. Centaurs fills that purpose nicely. Great if we get it, but fine if we don't.<br /> <br /> Of course there's always the strategy 