ry about Book of Going Westward until they publish it as the first supplement for Mummy 2e.<br /> <br /> But yes, an awesome campaign overall, and one that succeeded at the most important part: making me completely gloss over Origins and Hero in favor of obsessively coveting the inevitable Demigod crowdfunding campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T22:36:07-07:00","id":991288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991286#post991286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Always good strategy for the last stretch goal (or 2) to be something theoretically cool to have, but something that won't be cried over if missed. Don't want want a repeat of Mummy the Curse fans still smarting over the Book of Going Westward. Centaurs fills that purpose nicely. Great if we get it, but fine if we don't.<br /> <br /> Of course there's always the strategy of saying &quot;we'll counting Backerkit buy-ups toward any unachieved stretchgoals&quot; if there's something cool after Centaurs. That's always a popular move.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm going to cry about Book of Going Westward until they publish it as the first supplement for Mummy 2e.<br /> <br /> But yes, an awesome campaign overall, and one that succeeded at the most important part: making me completely gloss over Origins and Hero in favor of obsessively coveting the inevitable Demigod crowdfunding campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T02:35:10-07:00","id":991318,"title":"","content":"Now comes the process of waiting for the books to be finished and delivered. Well, by now I mean in six hours and 25 minutes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T06:42:01-07:00","id":991371,"title":"","content":"$10 to go before $230,000.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T06:44:50-07:00","id":991372,"title":"","content":"And there it is. We get centaurs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T06:50:41-07:00","id":991373,"title":"","content":"Next up is Satyrs for the Beastairy. 2 hours, fuck not a chance in hell.<br /> <br /> They should have gone with a $2,500 stretch goal, expand a section like Mantles or Relics, or an extra story for the anthology or a smaller monster section for the Beastary, not a $10,000 goal for 2 hours!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T06:58:46-07:00","id":991374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991373#post991373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Next up is Satyrs for the Beastairy. 2 hours, fuck not a chance in hell.<br /> <br /> They should have gone with a $2,500 stretch goal, expand a section like Mantles or Relics, or an extra story for the anthology or a smaller monster section for the Beastary, not a $10,000 goal for 2 hours!!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Question is whether there's anything they have they <i>can</i> do for $2,500.<br /> <br /> On the anthology, I note it's currently at ten stories, which would be a story for every core pantheon at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T07:05:22-07:00","id":991381,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna sound grumpy, but I would have definitely traded off every Anthology stretch goal with bestiary sections.<br /> <br /> I mean sure, I like neat stories, but I feel like the Anthology has taken a HUUUUGE amount of money out of the total. Where we could have had more stuff in the bestiary, or even the option to make it available for all backers, not only those who can afford both book's physical copies (and the shipping. That's what killed it for me, the international shipping. Can't spend 125 euros on just the corebook of a rpg, especially if I'll then have to do the translation myself for my players.) At least 20 dollars for the PDFs is a very decent price.<br /> <br /> /rant over. Sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T07:16:45-07:00","id":991385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991381#post991381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm gonna sound grumpy, but I would have definitely traded off every Anthology stretch goal with bestiary sections.<br /> <br /> I mean sure, I like neat stories, but I feel like the Anthology has taken a HUUUUGE amount of money out of the total. Where we could have had more stuff in the bestiary, or even the option to make it available for all backers, not only those who can afford both book's physical copies (and the shipping. That's what killed it for me, the international shipping. Can't spend 125 euros on just the corebook of a rpg, especially if I'll then have to do the translation myself for my players.) At least 20 dollars for the PDFs is a very decent price.<br /> <br /> /rant over. Sorry.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm dubious cost was the motive in limiting the Bestiary to physical backers.<br /> <br /> Plus, it's going to be available to everyone eventually, but physical backers get it first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T07:20:08-07:00","id":991388,"title":"","content":"No, it's going to be avaiable in stores. Physical backers will get it included in their whole package, while the rest will have to pay to get it.<br /> <br /> I mean I get that you have to make profits, sure, but I really find the Bestiary more useful for STs than an Anthology.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T08:07:40-07:00","id":991398,"title":"","content":"The anthology is them casting a wider net then just people who can actually play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:05:19-07:00","id":991424,"title":"","content":"I'd honestly have preferred satyrs over centaurs, myself; the tag-line about them being a thing for side adventures makes me genuinely curious about what role they were expected to fill.<br /> <br /> Still, I'm gonna be happy for what I got. Three PDFs for about six dollars each is not a bad deal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:11:19-07:00","id":991429,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Centaurs didn't really interest me at all. Only the word &quot;Nucklavee&quot; got my attention there- but, Satyr's would have been cool,-- I kinda wish they hadn't even told us that stretch goal.<br /> <br /> Ah well.<br /> <br /> It was a good kickstarter!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:32:14-07:00","id":991433,"title":"","content":"Actually its 6 PDFs and an Audio Interactive Drama for $20 USD.<br /> <br /> Scion: Origins PDF, Scion: Hero PDF, Scion: Companion PDF, Scion: Anthology PDF, Scion: Ready Made Characters PDF, Scion: Jump Start PDF, and Earplays Scion: Interactive Audio Drama.<br /> <br /> That $2.86 USD per PDF/audio drama.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:32:20-07:00","id":991434,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty hyped that centaurs are in, especially since it's not just the bikers iteration.<br /> <br /> I'm pretty bummed we didn't go that extra mile for Satyrs, though. Now I can't whine about it when they fail to include Ipotane with the rest of the animal people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11726,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11726-solana","user":"Solana","date":". 10-22-2016, 02:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11726-solana","name":"Solana","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11726_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:38:26-07:00","id":991439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrownedSun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991429#post991429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, Centaurs didn't really interest me at all. Only the word &amp;quot;Nucklavee&amp;quot; got my attention there- but, Satyr's would have been cool,-- I kinda wish they hadn't even told us that stretch goal.<br /> <br /> Ah well.<br /> <br /> It was a good kickstarter!</div> </div> </div> </div> The Motorcycle Centaurs sound cool, half man half Harley Davison Motorcycle!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:46:55-07:00","id":991445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991439#post991439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Motorcycle Centaurs sound cool, half man half Harley Davison Motorcycle!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank 1e Hero for that one, one of the things they decided to carry across editions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:49:38-07:00","id":991449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991433#post991433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually its 6 PDFs and an Audio Interactive Drama for $20 USD.<br /> <br /> Scion: Origins PDF, Scion: Hero PDF, Scion: Companion PDF, Scion: Anthology PDF, Scion: Ready Made Characters PDF, Scion: Jump Start PDF, and Earplays Scion: Interactive Audio Drama.<br /> <br /> That $2.86 USD per PDF/audio drama.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. Didn't know about some of those. Still, I was talking about the three I was most interested in, which are the core books and the companion.<br /> <br /> Cool beans, though, thanks for informing me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T10:56:34-07:00","id":991454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solana</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/991283-the-final-stretch?p=991434#post991434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm pretty bummed we didn't got that extra mile for Satyrs, though. Now I can't whine about it when they fail to include Ipotane with the rest of the animal people.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would have liked that as well. I was especially interested in the huldra and the tree women. That said, I think we should definitely petition that stretch goal to return in the Kickstarters for Demi-God or God.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1789-quinarch","name":"Quinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1789_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T12:05:37-07:00","id":991471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_conta